              <p class="service-price">From $99 <span>+ HST</span></p>
              <button class="toggle-service-btn" data-code="drone-aerial" data-service="Drone Aerial" data-price="99" type="button">
                <span class="btn-text">Add to Package</span>
                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>
