          <div class="reviews-grid">
            <article class="quote-card reveal-item"><div class="quote-stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</div><p>"Best real estate photographer I've worked with. The drone shots were next level and photos made the listing pop online immediately."</p><footer><strong>Sarah Mitchell</strong></footer></article>
            <article class="quote-card reveal-item"><div class="quote-stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</div><p>"Photos they produced were absolutely stunning. Commitment to customer satisfaction is truly impressive. Highly recommend!"</p><footer><strong>Sushaant Dhamijaa</strong></footer></article>
