                  <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/><line x1="19" y1="8" x2="19" y2="14"/><line x1="22" y1="11" x2="16" y2="11"/></svg>
                  Create Account
                </a>
